%% 4.1 会话启动 → 写四文档 → 释放（正常路径）
sequenceDiagram
    participant S as AI会话
    participant SLM as SessionLeaseManager
    participant SC as session_coordinator
    participant LR as layer_registry
    participant FD as 四文档文件

    S->>SLM: acquire_session_lease(ttl=60)
    SLM->>SC: acquire("session:jinshuiyao:collab", holder, stale_secs=60, wait_secs=0)
    SC-->>SLM: dict (写 .workbuddy/session_claim.json)
    SLM-->>S: True (SLM._active=True)
    Note over S,FD: 会话租约成立 → 进入协作

    S->>SLM: guard_four_docs_write(path)
    SLM->>LR: is_session_protected(path)
    LR-->>SLM: True
    SLM-->>S: True (已持租约，放行)

    S->>FD: 写四文档
    S->>SLM: heartbeat()  (每 <60s 保活)
    SLM->>SC: heartbeat(holder)

    S->>SLM: release_session_lease()
    SLM->>SC: release(holder, force=False)
    SC-->>SLM: True (CLAIM 清除，恢复空闲)
    SLM-->>S: True (SLM._active=False)

%% 4.2 编号分配带锁互斥（防并行撞号）
sequenceDiagram
    participant A as 会话A
    participant B as 会话B
    participant SLM as SessionLeaseManager
    participant SC as session_coordinator
    participant IDX as 工作留痕总索引

    A->>SLM: acquire_session_lease()
    SLM->>SC: acquire("session:jinshuiyao:collab","A",60,0)
    SC-->>SLM: dict
    A->>SLM: allocate_number(read_max_fn=读总索引最大号)
    SLM->>SLM: 校验 _active=True
    SLM->>IDX: read_max_fn() → JS-20260728-17
    SLM-->>A: 18 (=17+1)
    A->>SLM: release_session_lease()
    SC-->>SLM: 清空 CLAIM

    B->>SLM: acquire_session_lease()  (A已释放)
    SLM->>SC: acquire("session:jinshuiyao:collab","B",60,0)
    SC-->>SLM: dict
    B->>SLM: allocate_number(read_max_fn)
    SLM->>IDX: read_max_fn() → JS-20260728-18
    SLM-->>B: 19  (不撞号)

%% 4.3 超时自动回收 + fail-safe 降级
sequenceDiagram
    participant SC as session_coordinator
    participant Claim as session_claim.json
    participant Other as 其他会话/SLM
    participant LR as layer_registry

    Note over SC: 持有方 heartbeat 超 60s 未续期（stale_secs=60 触发）
    SC->>SC: acquire 时检测 heartbeat 过期 → 抢回 CLAIM
    SC->>Claim: 覆盖写入新 holder
    SC-->>Other: 租约回收，四文档锁+编号锁随 CLAIM 释放，无死锁

    Other->>SLM: acquire_session_lease()
    SLM->>SC: acquire("session:jinshuiyao:collab", Other, 60, 0)
    SC-->>SLM: dict (成功)

    Note over SLM,LR: fail-safe：若 CLAIM 文件损坏 / 锁异常
    SLM->>LR: write_alert("[G] 会话租约降级: ...")
    SLM-->>Other: 返回 False / None，不 raise，不翻转 all_ok，退出码 0
